[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11280.19, "timestamp": "03:08:00", "text": "没关系。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11284.23, "timestamp": "03:08:04", "text": "美好的。我的声音已经让人困惑了。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11286.309, "timestamp": "03:08:06", "text": "没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11288.63, "timestamp": "03:08:08", "text": "这家伙简直乐翻了。他会说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11290.469, "timestamp": "03:08:10", "text": "“这他妈是什么？这是什么玩意儿？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11296.11, "timestamp": "03:08:16", "text": "不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11305.67, "timestamp": "03:08:25", "text": "我希望如此。他肯定在骗我们，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11307.99, "timestamp": "03:08:27", "text": "知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11309.83, "timestamp": "03:08:29", "text": "谁知道呢。我可能是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11312.87, "timestamp": "03:08:32", "text": "实际的星座也是如此。可能是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11316.07, "timestamp": "03:08:36", "text": "这台电脑上实际显示的星座"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11319.75, "timestamp": "03:08:39", "text": "就像远在百万光年之外一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11322.389, "timestamp": "03:08:42", "text": "我的天啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11324.389, "timestamp": "03:08:44", "text": "他是个男的。我的天哪，我们遇到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11326.63, "timestamp": "03:08:46", "text": "又一次重复这个话题。慢跑，怎么样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11331.67, "timestamp": "03:08:51", "text": "做个男人是什么感觉？我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11335.19, "timestamp": "03:08:55", "text": "该死。就像我一样，是的，真正的悲伤在于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11338.79, "timestamp": "03:08:58", "text": "当它说“我不知道”的时候，就是这个声音。"}]